 "subs": [
  {
   "text": "This is a poker game. The\ndemo is three gigabytes.",
   "start": 0.9,
   "duration": 3.363,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "One file inside it is 1.6\nof them.",
   "start": 4.513,
   "duration": 3.337,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "K-God Robot Hunters is a\nKorean-fantasy poker\nroguelike. It went up on\nSteam yesterday.",
   "start": 8.1,
   "duration": 5.845,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "You play hands, and\ngoddesses rewrite them.",
   "start": 14.195,
   "duration": 3.128,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Unity, IL2CPP, 92 files.\nFor a card game that is\nalready a lot of build.",
   "start": 17.573,
   "duration": 6.89,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Two thirds of it is eight\nraw asset streams. The\nbiggest is 1.6 gigabytes\non its own.",
   "start": 24.713,
   "duration": 5.636,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "And every asset bundle in\nthe build is one thing:\nenemy animation, ante zero\nthrough eight.",
   "start": 30.599,
   "duration": 5.792,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 330,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
 ],
